#: ../developer/user-tags.md:1
msgid "User tags and the `unattended` tag"
msgstr "用户标签与 `unattended` 标签"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:3
msgid ""
"A user tag groups accounts and holds them to its own limits: a daily and "
"a monthly cost quota, a model allowlist and a cap on concurrent requests."
" Administrators add accounts by hand. A tag with an automatic rule also "
"gains every account that sent requests in at least *K* of the last *N* "
"hours. Manage tags under **Users → User tags** in the admin console, or "
"through the [admin API](#admin-api)."
msgstr ""
"用户标签把一组账户归在一起，并让它们遵守标签自己的限制：每日和每月费用额度、模型允许列表，以及并发请求上限。管理员可以手动添加账户。带自动规则的标签还会纳入在最近"
" *N* 小时中至少有 *K* 小时发送过请求的每个账户。在管理控制台的 **Users → User tags** 下管理标签，或使用[管理 "
"API](#admin-api)。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:5
msgid ""
"The gateway ships one tag with a rule, `unattended`. A person doesn't "
"send requests every hour for twelve hours; a script, a cron job or a "
"forgotten agent does. The tag has no limits until an administrator sets "
"some, so at first it only labels accounts."
msgstr ""
"网关自带一个带规则的标签：`unattended`。人不会连续十二个小时每小时都发请求；脚本、cron 任务或被遗忘的 agent "
"才会。管理员设置限制之前，这个标签没有任何限制，因此起初它只是给账户打上标记。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:7
msgid "How limits combine"
msgstr "限制如何组合"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:9
msgid ""
"A tag's limits are ceilings. A member is held to the strictest of its own"
" limit and the limits of every tag it carries:"
msgstr "标签的限制是上限。成员受其自身限制与所带每个标签限制中最严格者的约束："

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Combines as"
msgstr "合并方式"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Daily cost quota"
msgstr "每日费用配额"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The lowest of the account's own and each tag's. An account without a "
"daily quota of its own counts as the 1000 USD default."
msgstr "取账户自身与每个标签中的最低值。没有自身每日额度的账户按默认的 1000 USD 计算。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Monthly cost quota"
msgstr "每月费用配额"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "The lowest of the account's own (none means no limit) and each tag's."
msgstr "取账号自身配额（没有即不限）与各标签配额中的最小值。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Concurrent requests"
msgstr "并发请求"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The lowest of the account's cap (its own override, else its role's) and "
"each tag's, even for an unlimited role. Like the account's cap, it "
"applies to each concurrency budget separately: ordinary requests, "
"concurrency-exempt models and token counting."
msgstr ""
"取账户的上限（其自身覆盖值，否则为其角色的上限）与每个标签中的最低值，对不限并发的角色同样适用。与账户上限一样，它对每个并发预算分别生效：普通请求、免并发限制的模型和"
" token 计数。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Models"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"Only models on every tag's allowlist, on top of the role, disabled-model,"
" key and project checks. A tag without an allowlist allows every model; "
"allowlists that share no model allow none."
msgstr "只能使用每个标签允许列表中都有的模型，此外还要通过角色、已禁用模型、密钥和项目检查。没有允许列表的标签允许所有模型；彼此没有共同模型的允许列表则一个模型都不允许。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:18
msgid ""
"A tag can only narrow what an account may do, so tags never conflict, and"
" an automatic tag cannot loosen a limit an administrator set. To give a "
"group more, raise the accounts' own limits."
msgstr "标签只能收窄账户可做的事，因此标签之间不会冲突，自动标签也无法放宽管理员设置的限制。要给一组账户更多额度，请提高这些账户自身的限制。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:20
msgid ""
"The limits apply to API keys, inference grants from the cloud agent, "
"requests made on a user's behalf (`X-On-Behalf-Of`) and the console "
"playground. Batch work obeys a tag's quotas and allowlist, but its "
"concurrency is the batch scheduler's own per-role limit. `/v1/models` and"
" the console's model pickers hide models a tag doesn't allow, and `GET "
"/v1/key` and the usage dashboard report the tag's concurrency cap. A "
"change applies at once in the process that made it and within 30 seconds "
"in the others, when their cached auth lookups expire."
msgstr ""
"这些限制适用于 API 密钥、来自云端 agent 的推理授权、代表用户发出的请求（`X-On-Behalf-Of`）以及控制台 "
"Playground。批量任务遵守标签的额度和允许列表，但其并发由批量调度器自己的按角色限制决定。`/v1/models` "
"和控制台的模型选择器会隐藏标签不允许的模型，`GET /v1/key` "
"和用量仪表盘会报告标签施加的并发上限。修改在发起修改的进程中立即生效，在其他进程中最迟 30 秒内生效，也就是其缓存的认证查询过期之时。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:22
msgid ""
"Amounts are in the [ledger currency](accounting.md). A write names the "
"currency it was read in and is refused (409) if the ledger currency has "
"changed since. A quota stored in a currency the ledger has no rate for is"
" enforced as 0 (no spend) until an administrator enters it again; the "
"console flags such a tag."
msgstr ""
"金额以[账本币种](accounting.md)计。写入时须注明读取时的币种；如果账本币种此后已经改变，写入会被拒绝（409）。以账本没有汇率的币种保存的额度按"
" 0（不允许支出）执行，直到管理员重新输入；控制台会标出这样的标签。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:24
msgid "The automatic rule"
msgstr "自动规则"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:26
msgid ""
"A rule has a window of *N* hours (1–168) and a threshold of *K* active "
"hours (1–*N*). Every ten minutes a job counts, for each account, the "
"distinct rolling hours among the last *N* in which it has at least one "
"row in `api_logs`, and gives the tag to every active account with at "
"least *K*. Rows written by batch jobs don't count, because the gateway "
"sends batch requests at its own pace. Service accounts are never matched,"
" since they are unattended by design; to put a tag's limits on one, add "
"the tag to it by hand. `unattended` defaults to 12 of 12."
msgstr ""
"规则有一个 *N* 小时的窗口（1–168）和 *K* 个活跃小时的阈值（1–*N*）。每十分钟，一个任务为每个账户统计最近 *N* "
"个滚动小时中在 `api_logs` 里至少有一行记录的不同小时数，并把标签授予至少达到 *K* "
"的每个活跃账户。批量任务写入的行不计入，因为批量请求由网关按自己的节奏发送。服务账户从不会被匹配，因为它们本来就是无人值守的；要让某个服务账户受标签限制，请手动给它添加该标签。`unattended`"
" 默认为 12 中 12。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:28
msgid ""
"**Preview matches** in the editor shows whom another rule would match "
"before you save it: *20 of 24* catches fewer heavy human users, and *1 of"
" 6* catches anyone active in the last six hours. **Run rule now** runs a "
"tag's rule at once. Only one run happens at a time across replicas: the "
"job holds a PostgreSQL advisory lock, and a replica that can't take it "
"skips its turn."
msgstr ""
"编辑器中的 **Preview matches** 可在保存前显示另一条规则会匹配哪些账户：*20 of 24* 会少匹配一些重度人工用户，*1 "
"of 6* 会匹配最近六小时内任何活跃过的账户。**Run rule now** "
"会立即运行标签的规则。所有副本中同一时间只有一次运行：任务持有一个 PostgreSQL advisory lock，拿不到锁的副本跳过本轮。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:30
msgid ""
"The rule only adds members. Requests refused by the tag's own limits "
"aren't logged, so a rule that also removed members would lift the limits "
"from the very accounts they stopped. Removing a tag that has a rule keeps"
" the membership as `dismissed`, which applies no limits; the rule gives "
"the tag back only if the account's requests since the dismissal match "
"again. Removing the dismissed marker as well (the × on a struck-through "
"tag) forgets the dismissal, and adding the tag by hand makes any "
"membership manual."
msgstr ""
"规则只会添加成员。被标签自身限制拒绝的请求不会记入日志，所以一条也会移除成员的规则，恰恰会解除那些被限制住的账户的限制。移除一个带规则的标签时，成员关系会保留为"
" "
"`dismissed`，它不施加任何限制；只有当账户在被移除之后的请求再次匹配时，规则才会把标签加回来。连同已移除标记一起删除（点击带删除线标签上的"
" ×）会清除这次移除记录；手动添加该标签则会把任何成员关系变为手动。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:32
msgid "Admin API"
msgstr "管理 API"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:34
msgid ""
"Every endpoint needs admin authentication (a console session or "
"`ADMIN_TOKEN`), and every write is audited under a `user_tag.*` action."
msgstr "每个端点都需要管理员认证（控制台会话或 `ADMIN_TOKEN`），每次写入都以 `user_tag.*` 操作记入审计日志。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Method and path"
msgstr "方法与路径"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "`GET /admin/user-tags`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/user-tags`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Every tag with its limits, rule and member counts, built-in tags first."
msgstr "所有标签及其限制、规则和成员数，内置标签排在前面。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "`POST /admin/user-tags`"
msgstr "`POST /admin/user-tags`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"Create a tag: `name` (lowercase letters, digits, `-` and `_`, starting "
"with a letter or digit, at most 32), `description`, the limits and the "
"rule."
msgstr "创建标签：`name`（小写字母、数字、`-` 和 `_`，以字母或数字开头，最多 32 个字符）、`description`、各项限制和规则。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /admin/user-tags/{name}`"
msgstr "`PATCH /admin/user-tags/{name}`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Change only the fields sent; `null` clears a limit."
msgstr "只修改所发送的字段；`null` 清除一项限制。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE /admin/user-tags/{name}`"
msgstr "`DELETE /admin/user-tags/{name}`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"Delete a tag and its memberships. The built-in tag can't be deleted "
"(409); turn its rule off instead."
msgstr "删除标签及其所有成员关系。内置标签不能删除（409），可以改为关闭它的规则。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /admin/user-tags/{name}/members`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/user-tags/{name}/members`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The memberships, applied ones first; `source` (repeatable) filters by "
"`manual`, `auto` or `dismissed`."
msgstr "成员关系列表，生效的排在前面；`source`（可重复）按 `manual`、`auto` 或 `dismissed` 过滤。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /admin/user-tags/{name}/members`"
msgstr "`POST /admin/user-tags/{name}/members`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add accounts by hand: `{\"user_ids\": [...]}`. Unknown ids are reported, "
"not refused."
msgstr "手动添加账号：`{\"user_ids\": [...]}`。未知的 id 会在结果中列出，不会导致请求被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE /admin/user-tags/{name}/members/{user_id}`"
msgstr "`DELETE /admin/user-tags/{name}/members/{user_id}`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"Remove the tag from an account; under a rule, the membership is kept as "
"dismissed."
msgstr "从账号移除标签；标签带规则时，这条成员关系保留为已撤销。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /admin/user-tags/{name}/preview`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/user-tags/{name}/preview`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The accounts the rule matches now, read-only. `window_hours` and "
"`min_active_hours` try unsaved bounds."
msgstr "规则当前匹配的账户，只读。`window_hours` 和 `min_active_hours` 可试用尚未保存的参数。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /admin/user-tags/{name}/detect`"
msgstr "`POST /admin/user-tags/{name}/detect`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Run the rule now (409 when it is off)."
msgstr "立即运行规则（规则关闭时返回 409）。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The tag fields are `quota_daily_cost` and `quota_monthly_cost` (with "
"`currency`), `max_concurrent_requests`, `allowed_models` (canonical model"
" ids; an alias is stored as its model), `auto_enabled`, "
"`auto_window_hours` and `auto_min_active_hours`. `GET /admin/users` "
"accepts `tag=<name>` and returns each user's `tags`. `GET "
"/admin/users/{id}/detail` returns the account's `tag_memberships` "
"(dismissed ones included) and `tag_limits`, the combined limits of its "
"applied tags."
msgstr ""
"标签字段有 `quota_daily_cost` 和 `quota_monthly_cost`（附 "
"`currency`）、`max_concurrent_requests`、`allowed_models`（规范模型 "
"id；别名按其对应模型保存）、`auto_enabled`、`auto_window_hours` 和 "
"`auto_min_active_hours`。`GET /admin/users` 接受 `tag=<name>`，并返回每个用户的 "
"`tags`。`GET /admin/users/{id}/detail` 返回账户的 `tag_memberships`（包括已移除的）和 "
"`tag_limits`，即其生效标签合并后的限制。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:50
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "存储"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:52
msgid "Migration `0023_user_tags` adds two tables and seeds `unattended`:"
msgstr "迁移 `0023_user_tags` 新增两张表，并预置 `unattended`："

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:54
msgid ""
"`user_tags`: one row per tag with its limits (`NULL` for none) and rule; "
"`system` marks a built-in tag."
msgstr "`user_tags`：每个标签一行，包含其限制（`NULL` 表示无）和规则；`system` 标记内置标签。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:55
msgid ""
"`user_tag_members`: `(user_id, tag)` with `source` (`manual`, `auto` or "
"`dismissed`), `assigned_at` and `assigned_by` (the administrator's user "
"id, or `NULL` for the rule). A membership is deleted with its account or "
"its tag."
msgstr ""
"`user_tag_members`：`(user_id, tag)`，含 `source`（`manual`、`auto` 或 "
"`dismissed`）、`assigned_at` 和 `assigned_by`（管理员的用户 id；由规则添加时为 "
"`NULL`）。账户或标签被删除时，成员关系随之删除。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:57
msgid ""
"The auth lookups join an account's applied tags in the same query and "
"fold their limits into the row "
"([`serving.user_tags`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/apps/backend/serving/user_tags.py))."
" For an account without tags this costs one primary-key probe."
msgstr ""
"认证查询在同一条 SQL "
"中关联账号的生效标签，并把它们的限制合并进结果行（[`serving.user_tags`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/apps/backend/serving/user_tags.py)）。对没有标签的账号，代价是一次主键探查。"

